msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Language: ru\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"X-Game-Version: 2026.09.15.0000.0000\n"
"X-Source-Language: en\n"

#. ja: <ui-color 547>おや、どうしたんだい？<br>迷子になっちゃったのかな？</ui-color>
#. de: <ui-color 547>Na, Kleine<if $gn4><else>r</if>? Hast du dich verirrt? Kann ich dir irgendwie helfen?</ui-color>
#. fr: <ui-color 547>Tiens<nbsp>? Que fait <if $gn4>une jeune fille<else>un jeune garçon</if> comme toi <if $gn4>toute seule<else>tout seul</if> dans les rues d'Amaurote<nbsp>? Tu es perdu<if $gn4>e</if><nbsp>?</ui-color>
#. macro: <ui-color 547> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 547 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "custom/006/RegNor4Amaurot_00605:TEXT_REGNOR4AMAUROT_00605_AMOUROTGUIDE00605_000_000:1"
msgid "<ui-color 547>Is something wrong, little one? Are you perhaps lost and need me to help you locate your guardian?</ui-color>"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 何を聞く？
#. de: Was möchtest du wissen?
#. fr: Sur quoi vous renseignez-vous<nbsp>?
msgctxt "custom/006/RegNor4Amaurot_00605:TEXT_REGNOR4AMAUROT_00605_Q1_000_000:1"
msgid "What will you ask?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: あなたのことを教えてほしい
#. de: Was machst du hier?
#. fr: Votre interlocuteur
msgctxt "custom/006/RegNor4Amaurot_00605:TEXT_REGNOR4AMAUROT_00605_A1_000_001:1"
msgid "What do you do here?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: ここはどんなところだ？
#. de: Was ist das für ein Ort?
#. fr: Cet endroit
msgctxt "custom/006/RegNor4Amaurot_00605:TEXT_REGNOR4AMAUROT_00605_A1_000_002:1"
msgid "What kind of place is this?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: キャンセル
#. de: Nichts.
#. fr: Rien en particulier
msgctxt "custom/006/RegNor4Amaurot_00605:TEXT_REGNOR4AMAUROT_00605_A1_000_003:1"
msgid "Nothing."
msgstr ""

#. ja: <ui-color 547>私は、しがないアーモロート市民さ。<br>こうして仲間と議論をしたり、創造魔法の研究をしたり、<br>日々、知の研鑽をしているよ。</ui-color>
#. de: <ui-color 547>Ich? Ich bin nur ein einfacher Amaurotaner. Mal treffe ich mich hier mit Freunden zum Diskutieren, mal arbeite ich an meinen schöpfungsmagischen Fä<shy>hig<shy>kei<shy>ten<nbsp>- es gibt immer etwas zu tun, um den Geist weiterzuentwickeln.</ui-color>
#. fr: <ui-color 547>... Qui je suis<nbsp>? Euh... personne en particulier<nbsp>; juste un Amaurotain parmi tant d'autres... Quand je ne suis pas en train d'échanger des opinions, j'étudie la magie créatrice. Comme beaucoup, ma vie est consacrée à la poursuite de la con<shy>nais<shy>san<shy>ce.</ui-color>
#. macro: <ui-color 547> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 547 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "custom/006/RegNor4Amaurot_00605:TEXT_REGNOR4AMAUROT_00605_AMOUROTGUIDE00605_000_010:1"
msgid "<ui-color 547>Why, the same things most other citizens do, I suppose? I debate various topics with my compeers, I dabble in the arts of creation. Every day I attempt to better myself and the world in which I live.</ui-color>"
msgstr ""

#. ja: <ui-color 547>ここでは、市民の誰しもが、<br>世界の創造の一端を担わなくてはならない。<br>それはアーモロート市民だけに与えられた、名誉ある義務なんだ。</ui-color>
#. de: <ui-color 547>Jeder Bürger muss seinen Beitrag an der Schöpfung unserer Welt leisten. Das ist die ehrenvolle Pflicht, die uns Amaurotanern aufgetragen wurde.</ui-color>
#. fr: <ui-color 547>Tout un chacun se doit de contribuer à l'édification du monde. C'est notre privilège et notre devoir en tant qu'habitants de cette belle cité.</ui-color>
#. macro: <ui-color 547> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 547 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "custom/006/RegNor4Amaurot_00605:TEXT_REGNOR4AMAUROT_00605_AMOUROTGUIDE00605_000_011:1"
msgid "<ui-color 547>For we citizens of Amaurot are the caretakers of this world. Stewards who have harnessed the power of creation itself. It is an honor and a duty we do not consider lightly.</ui-color>"
msgstr ""

#. ja: <ui-color 547>君はまだまだ小さいけれど……<br>立派な市民になれるよう、勉学に励むんだよ。</ui-color>
#. de: <ui-color 547>Du bist noch jung und ungeformt, aber es ist wichtig, dass du dich nicht gehenlässt. Ich wünsche dir, dass du unablässig an dir arbeitest, damit einmal ein vorbildlicher Bürger aus dir wird.</ui-color>
#. fr: <ui-color 547>Tu es encore jeune, tu n'as pas à t'en soucier... Persévère dans tes études, et je suis sûr que tu deviendras un jour <if $gn4>une citoyenne<else>un citoyen</if> modèle.</ui-color>
#. macro: <ui-color 547> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 547 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "custom/006/RegNor4Amaurot_00605:TEXT_REGNOR4AMAUROT_00605_AMOUROTGUIDE00605_000_012:1"
msgid "<ui-color 547>You are yet young, so very, very young... You needn't concern yourself with such lofty concepts just yet. Attend to your studies, and I am certain you will grow into a proud citizen and avid creator.</ui-color>"
msgstr ""

#. ja: <ui-color 547>君はよその都市から、来たのかな？<br>ここは、世界でも最高峰の叡智が集まる首都、<br>アーモロートだよ。</ui-color>
#. de: <ui-color 547>Bist du denn nicht von hier? Nun, du befindest dich in Amaurot, der Hochburg des Wissens und der Weisheit dieser Welt.</ui-color>
#. fr: <ui-color 547>Oh, tu n'es pas d'ici<nbsp>? Je vois. Dans ce cas, je te souhaite la bienvenue à Amaurote, notre magnifique cité, qu'on pourrait également qualifier de capitale intellectuelle de cette planète.</ui-color>
#. macro: <ui-color 547> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 547 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "custom/006/RegNor4Amaurot_00605:TEXT_REGNOR4AMAUROT_00605_AMOUROTGUIDE00605_000_020:1"
msgid "<ui-color 547>Oh, do you hail from another city originally? Even so, surely you must know you stand in Amaurot, the intellectual utopia that flourishes at the heart of our world.</ui-color>"
msgstr ""

#. ja: <ui-color 547>最高議会の置かれているカピトル議事堂や、<br>学術機関アナイダアカデミア、人民管理局……。<br>都市機能の中枢管理は、一括してここで行われているんだ。</ui-color>
#. de: <ui-color 547>Das Kapitol, wo Gipfelgespräche allerhöchster Bedeutung geführt werden, die Akadaemia Anyder, wo alle Spitzenforschung betrieben wird, das Büro des Administrators<nbsp>... sämtliche wichtige Verwaltungsinstitutionen sind hier in engster Nachbarschaft versammelt.</ui-color>
#. fr: <ui-color 547>Tous les principaux organes de la ville sont concentrés autour d'ici. Tu as le Capitole pour la vie politique, l'Akadaemia Anydre pour la recherche, le forum des Éloquents et bien d'autres. Tu vas devoir t'armer de patience pour tout visiter.</ui-color>
#. macro: <ui-color 547> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 547 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "custom/006/RegNor4Amaurot_00605:TEXT_REGNOR4AMAUROT_00605_AMOUROTGUIDE00605_000_021:1"
msgid "<ui-color 547>From the Capitol where our preeminent minds gather to carry out the duties of governance, to the Akadaemia Anyder where devotees of knowledge strive to solve the greatest unsolved mysteries of our era, to the smaller but no less valuable institutions─Amaurot has all that you will ever need and so very much more.</ui-color>"
msgstr ""
